  "summary": [
    "C3 migrates the compiled X15 indexed simple-edge partition only. Every edge lies in some part, every part contains only edges, and distinct indices carry disjoint parts. Empty parts, repeated empty parts and zero indices remain allowed. The public count presentation and cardinal sum preserve index multiplicity.",
    "C1 already froze the source and all three affected statements over the pre-M1 edge set and original matching/perfect-matching bodies. C2 preserved those snapshots. C3 reuses them verbatim, adapts only C1’s partition bridge, and adds a small per-family entry point with three exact statement equivalences.",
    "X15alone remains excluded from the build. The four matching-underrepresentation variants and edge_family are unchanged. Multigraph list partitions, clique partitions and vertex partitions remain separate.",
    "Grounding covers zero parts iff edgeless, a nonempty K2 edge set with two repeated empty parts, rejection of duplicate nonempty parts and rejection of a loop member. The client imports public foundation modules only."
  ],
